    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. It feels like a lot of these \"rules-based orders\" are just a polite way for certain coalitions to push their own values on everyone else. Given that, do you think it's actually possible for a truly neutral international body to exist, or is the whole idea of global governance just a myth used to mask power politics?",
